  {
    "title": "e sounds like “e” in “best”, even at the end of a word",
    "body": "e is the short “e” of “best”, never “ee”. There are no silent letters, so a final e is always said.",
    "pattern": "e",
    "examples": [
      {
        "word": "žena",
        "say": "ZHE-na",
        "en": "woman, wife"
      },
